      "answerEn": "format; layout",
      "noteEn": "",
      "tags": [
        "word",
        "presentation",
        "noun",
        "A2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-tall-infographic-format-parody",
      "kind": "concept",
      "promptEs": "información · comunicada · formato",
      "answerEn": "a parody of a needlessly tall infographic that stretches a small claim into an elaborate visual journey",
      "noteEn": "The visual promises to show how all information will be communicated in the future, but its towering charts, giant lettering, circles, arrows, and redundant time conversions mainly demonstrate an unwieldy format. The final praise of the format is therefore ironic, matching the title's joke about making ‘big data’ literally big.",
      "tags": [
        "concept",
        "infographic",
        "data visualization",
        "comic joke"
      ]
    }
  ],
